      "body": "**Exact-head checks at `33a008af0536b3bfca9659c3f699dc7382be9704`** ran on pod aoq49jic2vhg1a (RTX 4090, its own CPU; not the laptop), in a fresh checkout of that SHA with `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/root/target-t`:\n- `cargo test --release -p uor-r4-training --example mqar-bench the_transformer_control_is_parameter_matched_to_the_geometric_arm` → **1 passed**. The frozen count 1,370,008 holds; the control solves at MLP 395 with 1,370,496 parameters.\n- `cargo test --release -p uor-r4-training --example mqar-bench` → **17 passed, 0 failed**.\n- `rustfmt --check` on `mqar-bench.rs` → clean.\n- Workspace `cargo fmt --check` → non-zero, but only on files this PR does not touch (older diffs already on main: `addressed-attention-*`, `demand-store-2turn.rs`, the `read_binding` hunks, …).\n\n**Self-review at the exact head:** the bound is now half an MLP unit (`3·width·layers/2` = 1,152), which is the correct rounding bound for the solve, and the new equality asserts pin the solved width and count. Test-only; no model or runtime change. APPROVE (self).",
